\">Unicode.DecodeIterator</a> <span class=\"fn\">δ</span> <span class=\"fn\">ι</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Char\">Char</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./UnicodeFormat/Iterator/Basic.html#Unicode.DecodeError.Kind\">Unicode.DecodeError.Kind</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`illFormed` consumes the ill-formed input where a strict decoding iterator stopped, and returns its\nkind, so that a parser can report it and go on after it. Fails, consuming nothing, at well-formed\ninput and at the end of the input. On a lossy decoding iterator, it consumes ill-formed input\nbefore it is replaced with U+FFFD.","docLink":"./ParseIt/UTF.html#ParseIt.UTF.illFormed","kind":"def","line":44,"name":"ParseIt.UTF.illFormed","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-parseit/blob/e6e5209e99f663979fe00fab827de75de2d666d3/ParseIt/UTF.lean#L44-L58"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ParseIt/UTF.html#ParseIt.UTF32Iterator\"><span class=\"name\">ParseIt</span>.<span class=\"name\">UTF32Iterator</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The iterator over the characters of UTF-32 code units.","docLink":"./ParseIt/UTF.html#ParseIt.UTF32Iterator","kind":"def","line":39,"name":"ParseIt.UTF32Iterator","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-parseit/blob/e6e5209e99f663979fe00fab827de75de2d666d3/ParseIt/UTF.lean#L39-L40"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ParseIt/UTF.html#ParseIt.UTF16Iterator\"><span class=\"name\">ParseIt</span>.<span class=\"name\">UTF16Iterator</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The iterator over the char